# Protocol marker lines from FireSim queue job 734's UART (the six-GEMM-shape head-to-head,
# hw_config alveo_u250_firesim_gemmini_rocket_30mhz, bitstream artifact
# 2026-09-17--05-57-16-alveo_u250_firesim_gemmini_rocket_30mhz, submitted as workload
# 'merlin-checkpoint'), in order, from its uartlog; every other line dropped.  The only edit is
# stripping each line's trailing CR: the FPGA console emits CRLF and git would rewrite it anyway.
# The line content itself is untouched.
#
# THE FIRST BATCHED RUN ON HARDWARE.  Until this log, merlin.perf.firesim_batch's own docstring said
# of the MERLIN_BATCH/MERLIN_WINDOW frame "THE UART FRAME IS PROPOSED, NOT OBSERVED" -- the module
# could link and admit a batch nothing had ever printed.  This is a real run of a real build: 13
# measured windows in ONE runworkload-full, 6 GEMM shapes x 2 arms plus an order-effect control that
# repeats window 0.
#
#   elf_sha256          866758e423b8bfdb3033b775bdce9a35da360d5249bf34e383c3f08e833425aa
#   operand_blob_sha256 4ea6c5b52b537c3945a446a97c08d50847d5653b8dcf7b605fbf9df0c8bb7690
#   uartlog_sha256      52a9d21da0fe43a99b1cadc06599732aa6e92ffd9761a177ee61a2671230443f
#   batch_id            gemm6x2
#   order effect        26 ppm (531,701 -> 531,715 on the repeated window 0)
#
# EVERY WINDOW'S DIGEST EQUALS THE ORACLE.  The digest on each LB_RECORD line is the FNV-1a word
# digest of that window's output, and each equals what merlin.perf.layer_bench.reference computes
# off-device in exact integer arithmetic for the same spec.  That is what makes these cycle counts
# results rather than numbers: FireSim job 730 cleared both its declared cycle thresholds, printed
# an argmax marker byte-identical to a correct run's, and was wrong.
#
# Kept so the batched frame is pinned to a log the hardware produced, the way
# job610_uart_marker_skeleton.log pins the solo one, rather than to a shape someone wrote to match
# the parser.
MERLIN_INVOCATIONS warmup=1 measured=1
MERLIN_BATCH begin id=gemm6x2 windows=13
MERLIN_WINDOW begin label=s512x512x512
MERLIN_PROFILE warmup begin
MERLIN_PROFILE warmup end rc=0
MERLIN_PROFILE measured begin
LB_RECORD s512x512x512 cycles=531701 digest=8466922728085698976
LB_DONE s512x512x512
METRIC cycles 531701
MERLIN_PROFILE measured end rc=0
MERLIN_WINDOW end label=s512x512x512
MERLIN_WINDOW begin label=l512x512x512
